{"words": [{"text": "وَمِنْهُم", "translation": "And from those"}, {"text": "مَّن", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "يَقُولُ", "translation": "say"}, {"text": "رَبَّنَآ", "translation": "Our Lord"}, {"text": "ءَاتِنَا", "translation": "Grant us"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلدُّنْيَا", "translation": "the world"}, {"text": "حَسَنَةًۭ", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "وَفِى", "translation": "and in"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ", "translation": "the Hereafter"}, {"text": "حَسَنَةًۭ", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "وَقِنَا", "translation": "and save us"}, {"text": "عَذَابَ", "translation": "(from the) punishment"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ", "translation": "(of) the Fire"}], "sahih": "But among them is he who says, \"Our Lord, give us in this world [that which is] good and in the Hereafter [that which is] good and protect us from the punishment of the Fire.\""}